; the context: one field per feature-scope variable — name: scope, merge (feature)
;   out: the output device, which stores nothing (platform)
;   in: user, last (platform)
;   t: user, last (lex)
;   src: user, last (lex)
;   u: user, last (lex)
;   __node1_c: node, last (lex)
;   __node1_c_seen: node, last (lex)
;   __node1_fin: node, last (lex)
;   __node2_c: node, last (lex)
;   __out_n, __clock, __out_p: the context's own output and clock (question 107): how much it has written, its time and its capture
